"answer": "Treatments for rashes may include moisturizers, lotions, baths, cortisone creams to relieve swelling, and antihistamines to relieve itching [MLP-208]. Additionally, for itching associated with rashes, treatments can involve cold compresses, moisturizing lotions, lukewarm or oatmeal baths, over-the-counter hydrocortisone cream, and antihistamines [MLP-3067]. For severe swelling from spider bites, which can cause rash-like reactions, antihistamines are also suggested [MLP-5249]."
}
